    "id": 584229,
    "title": "IEEE QLD Section AGM 2026",
    "description": "<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Dear IEEE Queensland Section Member,</p>\r\n<p>You are cordially invited to attend the <strong>2026 IEEE Queensland Section Annual General Meeting (AGM)</strong>. The meeting details are as follows:</p>\r\n<p><strong>Date:</strong> Thursday, 19 November 2026<br><strong>Time:</strong> 4:30 pm &ndash; 5:30 pm<br><strong>Venue:</strong> Sky S1 Meeting Room, Brisbane Convention and Exhibition Centre (BCEC), Grey Street, South Brisbane, QLD<br><strong>Online attendance:</strong> A Zoom option will be available (pre-registration required, details to be confirmed).</p>\r\n<p>The meeting agenda and minutes of the 2025 AGM will be circulated closer to the event.</p>\r\n<p>If you plan to attend in person, please register using the link provided in this event notice.</p>\r\n<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\"><strong>The event flyer, including details of the IEEE Queensland Section Annual Dinner, can be found below.</strong></p>\r\n<p>We look forward to your participation!</p>\r\n<p>Kind regards,</p>\r\n<p>Hugo Espinosa<br>Vice-Chair, IEEE QLD Section</p>",
