    "id": 584211,
    "title": "NEXTGEN INNOVATORS 2026",
    "description": "<p><img src=\"https://events.vtools.ieee.org/vtools_ui/media/display/c837694e-e8a7-465c-a966-42503f88fcd0\" width=\"1008\" height=\"1344\"></p>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAICxAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\"><strong class=\"rQesXe MPyX\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\">NEXTGEN INNOVATORS 2026: Hackathon &mdash; 2.&ordf; Edici&oacute;n<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></strong> es un evento intensivo de tres d&iacute;as coorganizado por<strong> </strong><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\">IEEE WIE UNMSM<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><strong>, </strong><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\">WIE PUCP</span> y <span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\">WIE UNFV</span>. <strong>👩&zwj;💻✨</strong><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAIDBAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\">Esta hackathon est&aacute; dise&ntilde;ada para todas las personas apasionadas por el <span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\">mundo STEM<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> 🧠💡. Brinda una plataforma colaborativa donde los participantes podr&aacute;n compartir ideas, trabajar en equipo y desarrollar soluciones tecnol&oacute;gicas e innovadoras que generen un impacto real y duradero en dos pilares cruciales:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiklveL4rCXAxXIqZUCHTOKPPkQ-7AUegYIAAgNEAA\" data-hveid=\"CAAIDRAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\">\r\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAIDRAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-complete=\"true\">📚 <span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\">Educaci&oacute;n<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\r\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAIDRAC\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-complete=\"true\">⚖️ <span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\">Equidad de G&eacute;nero<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\r\n<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAIDhAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\"><span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\">📅 Detalles del Evento:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<ul class=\"KsbFXc U6u95\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwiklveL4rCXAxXIqZUCHTOKPPkQ-7AUegYIAAgPEAA\" data-hveid=\"CAAIDxAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\">\r\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAIDxAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-complete=\"true\">📆 <span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\">Fechas:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> 29, 30 y 31 de octubre de 2026<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\r\n<li class=\"Z1qcYe\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAIDxAC\" data-complete=\"true\" data-sae=\"\"><span class=\"iNqyIf\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-complete=\"true\">🚨 <span class=\"rQesXe MPyX\">Cierre de Inscripciones:<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span> 22 de octubre de 2026<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></span><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></li>\r\n<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></ul>\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAIEBAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\">&iexcl;&Uacute;nete a nosotros para desafiar tus habilidades, hacer networking y ser parte de la pr&oacute;xima generaci&oacute;n de innovadores! 💜👾<!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"yhAwj\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" data-sfc-inited=\"2\"><!--TgQPHd|||[]--></div>\r\n<div class=\"AHmQrc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAIEhAA\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"n6owBd awi2gc\" data-sfc-cp=\"\" data-sfc-root=\"ep\" data-epip=\"\" data-hveid=\"CAAIEhAB\" data-complete=\"true\" data-processed=\"true\" aria-owns=\"action-menu-parent-container\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>",
